<jmeterTestPlan version="1.2" properties="5.0" jmeter="5.6.3">
  <hashTree>
    <TestPlan guiclass="TestPlanGui" testclass="TestPlan" testname="EShop SPIKE - 23127362 - 2026-08-15" enabled="true">
      <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Kich ban SPIKE. Do kha nang hap thu va PHUC HOI sau tai dot bien.
Nen 25 thread (18/6/1), hai xung len 200 thread (140/50/10) = 8x nen.
Moc thoi gian: nen on dinh t=30..120 | XUNG 1 t=120..200 | HOI PHUC t=200..380 (180s)
               | XUNG 2 t=380..460 | quan sat sau t=460..600.
Ba Ultimate Thread Group (plugin jpgc-casutg 3.1.1). Ramp cua xung chi 10s -- xung phai
DOT NGOT; ramp 30s se bien no thanh mot bac thang nua va mat dung thu can do.

k = 1.0, GIU NGUYEN think time cua Load: TG-1 = 20s, TG-2 = 2s, TG-3 = 12s.
Ly do khong nen think time nhu Stress: (1) phep so sanh trung tam la XUNG 2 vs XUNG 1,
tu tham chieu san, khong can so voi kich ban khac; (2) mot spike theo dinh nghia la bien
dong dot ngot cua SO NGUOI DUNG DONG THOI, khong phai cua nhip thao tac moi nguoi.
Throughput ly thuyet: 9.8 req/s o nen, 79.0 req/s o dinh xung.

TIEU CHI:
  p95 trong moi xung        &lt;= 5 x p95 baseline cua kich ban Load
  Thoi gian phuc hoi        p95 ve &lt;= 1.2 x baseline trong vong 60s sau khi xung tat
  p95 xung 2 / p95 xung 1   &lt;= 1.2   &lt;-- TIEU CHI TRUNG TAM cua ca kich ban
  technical error rate      = 0.00%  (sau khi loc bo nhan OBS_*)
  loi ket noi / timeout     = 0
Vuot 1.2 nghia la he thong KHONG tro ve trang thai ban dau sau xung dau -- voi userCarts
khong bao gio duoc giai phong va hang doi ghi co the chua rut can, day la ket qua hoan
toan co co so de ky vong.

PHAN TICH: loc bo moi nhan bat dau bang OBS_ truoc khi tinh bat ky chi so nao.
CHAY NGAY SAU KHI: restart server -&gt; provision-accounts.js -&gt; warm-up.</stringProp>
      <boolProp name="TestPlan.functional_mode">false</boolProp>
